        {
          "id": 823671247,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@geraldcombs \nI assume I did this to myself attempting to use Creator in the past.  \nBetter to purge the files or add the line back to `.gitignore` ?\n\n`- /wireshark-qt*`\n\n```\nwireshark$ git status\nOn branch lua_docs_tree_item\nYour branch is up to date with 'downstream/lua_docs_tree_item'.\n\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n        wireshark-qt.cflags\n        wireshark-qt.config\n        wireshark-qt.creator\n        wireshark-qt.creator.user\n        wireshark-qt.creator.user.479b36c\n        wireshark-qt.cxxflags\n        wireshark-qt.files\n        wireshark-qt.includes\n\nnothing added to commit but untracked files present (use \"git add\" to track)\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/chuckcraft"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-01-27T15:00:19.778Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-01-27T15:54:35.551Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 136541821,
