        {
          "id": 823824349,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Were you able to build Wireshark using this configuration? The only reference to those extensions I can find off hand is in the [generic project documentation](https://doc.qt.io/qtcreator/creator-project-generic.html). I'm assuming they're specific to [qmake or Qbs](https://doc.qt.io/qtcreator/creator-project-creating.html#selecting-the-build-system).\n\nWhen I [open CMakeLists.txt in Qt Creator](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html_chunked/ChUIQt.html#_qt_creator) here it stores its settings in [CMakeLists.txt.user](https://www.qt.io/blog/cmake-project-configuration-in-qt-creator-4.13). I don't see any of the extensions above.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789887783",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-01-27T16:47:35.487Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-01-27T16:47:35.487Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 136541821,
